# Google OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID
# Obtain from Google Cloud Console: APIs & Services -> Credentials -> Create OAuth Client ID (Web Application)
# Authorized JavaScript Origins: http://localhost:3000, https://your-domain.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id-here.apps.googleusercontent.com
